---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<BaseLayout title="PEEK挤出头CFD仿真" sideBarActiveItemID="projects">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <!-- 顶部返回按钮 -->
    <div class="mb-4">
      <a
        href="/projects"
        onclick="if(history.length > 1) { history.back(); return false; }"
        class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm gap-2"
      >
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="16"
          height="16"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
        >
          <path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"></path>
        </svg>
        返回项目列表
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-4">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold">面向PEEK的高温FDM喷头流热耦合仿真</div>
      <div class="text-lg text-base-content/70 mt-1">
        Numerical Simulation of Thermal-Fluid Coupling for PEEK High-Temperature Extrusion Nozzle
      </div>
      <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <span class="badge badge-primary">仿真分析</span>
        <span class="badge badge-outline">CFD</span>
        <span class="badge badge-outline">流热耦合</span>
        <span class="badge badge-outline">PEEK特种塑料</span>
        <span class="badge badge-outline">ANSYS Fluent</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">项目概述</h2>
      <p class="text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
        针对PEEK等聚合物材料粘度高、熔融区间窄、易降解的特性，建立高熔点聚合物熔融挤出过程的非牛顿流体流热耦合三维有限元模型。
        通过流热耦合数值计算，分析不同打印速度与加热功率下熔融腔内部流场与温度场分布，指导热端几何结构与流道优化设计。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">仿真模型与云图结果</h2>
      <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-lg">
        <div class="card-body">
          <Image
            src="/fig-cfd-simulation.png"
            alt="PEEK熔丝挤出喷头流热耦合仿真云图"
            width={800}
            height={450}
            format="webp"
            class="rounded-lg w-full"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-base-content/70 mt-3 text-sm">
        流热耦合仿真温度场与剪切速率分布云图
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">技术参数与计算条件</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="table table-zebra w-full">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>计算参数</th>
              <th>设定值 / 选用模型</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>熔融物料</td>
              <td>PEEK 450G（聚醚醚酮）</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>熔体流变模型</td>
              <td>Cross-WLI 非牛顿流体粘度模型</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>加热区目标温度</td>
              <td>380°C - 420°C</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>喷嘴出口直径</td>
              <td>0.4 mm</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>最大挤出压力</td>
              <td>15.2 MPa</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>仿真求解器</td>
              <td>ANSYS Fluent / COMSOL Multiphysics</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">核心结论与工程价值</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="card-title text-lg">熔体流动滞留区消除</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
              通过流场分析优化过渡区流道锥角，消除死角滞留区，防止高温下 PEEK 热降解碳化
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="card-title text-lg">挤出压力背压降低</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
              优化流道阻力特征，将高黏度 PEEK 挤出所需的最大驱动力降低 22%，有效避免丢步
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">相关资源</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <a class="btn btn-sm btn-ghost" href="/projects">← 返回项目列表</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
